# 5.0 release gate pattern: per-phase smoke output gitignore.
# Desensitize: no absolute user-data paths, no API keys, no raw provider responses, no generated images.

# Image artifacts are gitignored (preserved locally for review only)
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png

